@startuml 03-list-documents
title GET /api/documents - paginowana lista dokumentów tenanta

actor Client as C
participant "RequestIdFilter" as RIF
participant "TenantContextFilter" as TCF
participant "DocumentController" as Ctrl
participant "ListDocumentsUseCase\n(DocumentService)" as DS
participant "DocumentRepository" as DR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

C -> RIF: GET /api/documents?page=0&size=20&sort=uploadedAt,desc
activate RIF
RIF -> TCF: chain.doFilter()
activate TCF
note over TCF #LightBlue: TenantContext.set(DEFAULT_TENANT)

TCF -> Ctrl: listDocuments(page, size, sort)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> DS: list(Pageable)
activate DS
DS -> DR: findAllSummaries(pageable)
DR -> DB: SELECT id, filename, mime_type, size_bytes,\n  status, uploaded_at\nFROM documents\nWHERE tenant_id = ? \n  --> filtr dodany automatycznie\n      przez Hibernate @TenantId\nORDER BY uploaded_at DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
DR --> DS: Page<DocumentSummary>
DS --> Ctrl: Page<DocumentSummary>
deactivate DS

Ctrl -> Ctrl: mapuj na\nPaginatedDocumentResponse\n(content + pagination meta)

Ctrl --> TCF: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
TCF --> RIF: response
deactivate TCF
RIF --> C: 200 + JSON:\n{ content: [...],\n  pagination: {totalElements, totalPages, ...} }
deactivate RIF

note over Client #LightBlue: Frontend (TanStack Query)\ncache'uje response\nkey ['documents', {page, size, sort}]

@enduml
